UserInterface --> ContextEngine : questions and settings
UserInterface --> NotificationService : acknowledge, mute, Focus
NotificationService --> UserInterface : notices and status

ContextEngine --> RecommendationService : requests grounded advice
ContextEngine --> NotificationService : submits eligible notices
ContextEngine --> DataRepository : context and preferences
NotificationService --> DataRepository : acknowledgements and logs

ContextEngine --> HardwareGateway : readings, controls, health
NotificationService --> HardwareGateway : approved output requests

HardwareGateway --> SensorController : acquires readings
HardwareGateway --> InputController : receives input events
HardwareGateway --> OutputController : dispatches bounded commands
HardwareGateway --> PeripheralAdapter : display and Bluetooth

InputController --> OutputController : immediate local buzzer stop

Simulator ..> ContextEngine : labeled test context
Simulator ..> RecommendationService : model fault tests
Simulator ..> HardwareGateway : contract and recovery tests

